  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.1.0.0 - initial release.\n\t\t\t- AuditAndMetricsClient, with an AuditClient and a MetricClient: log (deferred) or record (awaited) audits and metrics, retrieve, modify and remove them, and purge them by retention period.\n\t\t\t- Entries are validated and stamped with the current user and time on the caller's thread, then written through the host's dispatcher so recording never slows a request.\n\t\t\t- Each stored metric span is replayed to an ActivitySource, NHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics by default, for Application Insights or OpenTelemetry.\n\t\t\t- Audits and metrics are switched on, retained and purged independently.\n\t\t\t- Cancellation is never wrapped: an OperationCanceledException always passes through untouched.\n\t\t\t- Guide and sample: https://github.com/NHSISL/NHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics",
